enario-clay-plant-stop>, 13:00:49 UTC", "output": "MQTT: mine.sim_time=2026-10-26T21:32:40, weather.condition=rain, scenario-heavy-rain.status=active, scenario-clay-plant-stop.status=active. Ditto: mine.sim_time=2026-10-26T19:00:00, weather.condition=dry, оба сценария inactive."}, {"command": "Повторная сверка MQTT и GET двойников через API Ditto, 13:02:40 UTC", "output": "MQTT: mine.sim_time=2026-10-26T22:09:40. Ditto: mine.sim_time=2026-10-26T19:20:20. Задержка выросла до 2 ч 49 мин 20 с модельного времени."}, {"command": "docker logs --since 10s openegiz-connectivity-1 2>&1 | grep 'Dropped message as result of backpressure' | head -2", "output": "2026-10-27 13:01:14,042 ERROR OutboundMappingProcessorActor ... mosquitto-target-connection ... Dropped message as result of backpressure strategy! - result was: Dropped - adjust queue size or scaling if this appears regularly"}, {"command": "POST /ditto/api/2/things/kz.bozshakol:scenario-<имя>/inbox/messages/cancel?timeout=0 с телом {}; проверка docker logs --since 4m openegiz-mine-sim-1 и MQTT telemetry/#", "output": "Отмена дождя получена симулятором в 13:01:11, отмена ОФ-2 — в 13:01:50 UTC. В 13:02:40 текущая телеметрия всех восьми сценариев: inactive; weather.condition=dry. Код, конфигурация и контейнеры не изменялись."}]}]}
